  'site.door.title': 'Did I lock the back door?',
  'site.door.p1': "Did I is the unanswered question for today. One on the plate. Hit Did if you did it. Hit Not yet if you have not done it yet.",
  'site.door.p2': "Home says what is left. Today is where you tap Did or Not yet. Folders group questions. The cog is settings.",
