  'web.landing.strip.tonight': "Today",
  'web.landing.strip.vol': "The daily log / Vol. 01",
  'web.landing.hero.kicker': "It comes to you",
  'web.landing.hero.title': "For people who forget",
  'web.landing.hero.titleEm': "to open habit trackers.",
  'web.landing.hero.lead': "Habit trackers only work if you remember to open them. Did I brings the question to you instead: a widget on your home screen, your watch, or a reminder at the time you set. One question at a time, with nothing else on the screen. Swipe right for Did, left for Not yet. Or check them all at the end of the day. Then your head can let it go.",
  'web.landing.hero.c1': "One thing on screen",
  'web.landing.hero.c2': "Asks when you choose",
  'web.landing.hero.c3': "No guilt for a miss",
  'web.landing.hero.c4': "Free",
  'web.landing.phone.aria': "A question in Did I being swiped right for Did",
  'web.landing.phone.q1': "Set my alarm",
  'web.landing.phone.f1': "Morning",
  'web.landing.phone.q2': "Eat lunch",
  'web.landing.phone.f2': "Me",
  'web.landing.phone.q3': "Charge my phone",
  'web.landing.phone.f3': "Home",
  'web.landing.phone.card': "Did I close the garage?",
  'web.landing.log.kicker': "What gets in the way",
  'web.landing.log.count': "4 entries",
  'web.landing.log.title': "The things that get in the way, and what Did I does about them",
  'web.landing.e1.kicker': "01 / The loop",
  'web.landing.e1.title': "\"I know I did it. I just can't remember doing it.\"",
  'web.landing.e1.p1': "Write each question once and pick when it comes to you: every day, every few days, just once, or every so often after you do it. Give it a time, like the morning, and it shows up then. Or leave it and check them all at the end of the day. One at a time, so you always know what comes next. Did it? Swipe right. Not yet? Swipe left.",
  'web.landing.e1.p2': "No long list staring back at you. Home shows only what's still open.",
  'web.landing.e1.r1': "Did I eat lunch?",
  'web.landing.e1.r2': "Did I set my alarm?",
  'web.landing.e1.r3': "Did I reply to that email?",
  'web.landing.e1.open': "Still open",
  'web.landing.e1.capTitle': "Exhibit A / Home",
  'web.landing.e1.cap': "Two answered, one still open. Folders keep things sorted, so nothing gets lost.",
  'web.landing.e2.kicker': "02 / Out of sight, out of mind",
  'web.landing.e2.title': "\"If I can't see it, it doesn't exist.\"",
  'web.landing.e2.p1': "You never have to remember to open Did I. Give a question a time and it buzzes you then. A widget keeps the next question on your home screen, where you'll see it, and you can answer it right there.",
  'web.landing.e2.p2': "On your watch, answer from your wrist. A ring fills as you go, and your buddy comes along.",
  'web.landing.e2.widgetMeta': "Today · 2 left",
  'web.landing.e2.widgetQ': "Did I pack my charger?",
  'web.landing.e2.watchMeta': "Me · 2 of 3",
  'web.landing.e2.watchQ': "Did I drink water?",
  'web.landing.e2.capTitle': "Exhibit B / Widget and watch",
  'web.landing.e2.cap': "Answer without opening the app and getting pulled into something else.",
  'web.landing.e3.kicker': "03 / Support",
  'web.landing.e3.title': "\"It helps when someone checks in.\"",
  'web.landing.e3.p1': "Let the people close to you help, without nagging. Send a friend a question, once or every day. It lands in their inbox and they choose to keep it. Start a family and share the code, and \"Did you take the dog out?\" shows up for everyone in it.",
  'web.landing.e3.p2': "Did we is for things you do together: pick who's in, pick when it counts, and keep a streak together. See who's done today and send a cheer when someone finishes.",
  'web.landing.e3.r1': "Did we water the garden?",
  'web.landing.e3.s1': "Both did",
  'web.landing.e3.r2': "Did you take the dog out?",
  'web.landing.e3.s2': "Waiting",
  'web.landing.e3.r3': "Did you book the dentist?",
  'web.landing.e3.capTitle': "Exhibit C / Friends and family",
  'web.landing.e3.cap': "Did you, family questions and Did we, side by side.",
  'web.landing.e4.kicker': "04 / Pressure",
  'web.landing.e4.title': "\"Most apps make me feel bad when I miss a day.\"",
  'web.landing.e4.p1': "Not yet is a fine answer. Nothing flashes red and nothing scolds you. Streaks are there if they help. If the number stresses you out, turn on gentle mode: streak numbers hide, and your days still count.",
  'web.landing.e4.days': "M T W T F S S",
  'web.landing.e4.gentle': "Gentle mode",
  'web.landing.e4.gentleLine': "Hide streak numbers. Days still count.",
  'web.landing.e4.capTitle': "Exhibit D / Settings",
  'web.landing.e4.cap': "The week stays. The pressure goes.",
  'web.landing.keep.kicker': "What you keep",
  'web.landing.keep.title': "Calm, the way you like it.",
